'''Hunting Club''' (猟友会, ''Ryōyūkai'', '''Hunting Companions''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 13.1 Update|Version 13.1]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
"Slow" Effect UP (Sm): Slow duration increases by 10%.

